algorithms: implement tpm-rs's algorithm set

Classification: profile setting.

The implemented algorithms and curves are a profile choice. Disables what
tpm-rs does not implement (Camellia, CMAC, RSA-3072/4096, SM2, EC-Schnorr,
ECMQV, ML-KEM, ML-DSA and the NIST P-192, BN P-638 and SM2 P-256 curves), so
that TPM_CAP_ALGS, TPM_CAP_ECC_CURVES and the accepted algorithm IDs agree.
(SHA-512, which tpm-rs implements, is already enabled in version 185.)
